>1. how do i bring a pet archon down passed the castle lever if the
>level does not have a staircase?

  'a'pplying a leash to your pet Archon before stepping on a trapdoors
would work in plain Nethack.  After you fall through stay in one place
until the leash pulls the Archon next to you, otherwise you may snap the
leash loose from the Archon by moving.  (Snapping the leash loose
probably lowers tameness.)

  Or be sure that the Archon is next to the trapdoors before you step on
the trapdoors square.  So the following arrangement should work:

  ------
  .A^@..
  ------

  If you're set up like the above then stepping onto the trapdoors
that's between you and your tame Archon should work.

>
>2. if the archon does not eat, how do i keep it a happy pet?  

  Spell of charm monster cast enough times while adjacent to the Archon
should increase its tameness at some point.  It's got a fairly low
probability of success, so just keep doing it every so often.  

  I've successfully tamed hostile Archons this way, so surely it will
eventually increase the tameness of an Archon.

